//   (cost 1, familyMask 1) is the same speed-10 projectile_enemy_bldbat; on its accepted hit bldrat_t_1[blood] (the
//   Gnawbeast's Bleed program) puts blood_dec on a non-token, non-trap target: blood_value HP lost every second for
//   blood_duration s, unless the Vesperwing is silenced.
// - Wasteland Robber (enemy_1337_bhrknf) / Elite (_2): Physical; blocked it strikes its blocker (Combat, Attack_2),
//   otherwise it shoots (Attack, Attack_1, speed-10 projectile_enemy_bhrknf). SP +1 per attack (max maxSp); the
//   CostMelee/CostRangedAttack skills (cost spCost) make the next attack a cost attack whose accepted hit on a non-token,
//   non-trap target runs bhrknf_t_1[cost]: ModifyCost cost (-1 DP) unless the Robber is silenced.
// - Both "prioritize the Holy Statue", a stage device whose priority is not modelled: the runtimes refuse any stage
//   with devices (HE-EX-1 has none).
